    "_postman_id": "ca7d81cb-ce09-4485-925b-786dedbbd223",
    "name": "Crisis Helplines Countries API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "A public API providing crisis helpline data organized by country. This API serves mental health and crisis support helpline information to help integrate crisis resources into your application.\n\n## Features\n- Comprehensive helpline data by country\n- Country alias support (e.g., \"USA\" resolves to \"United States\")\n- CORS-enabled for web applications\n- No authentication required (public API)\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: API Support",
